  "description": "OLE-TXN with DDL on a read/write copy: BeginTrans, CREATE TABLE TxnDdl, INSERT a row, ALTER TABLE Items ADD COLUMN Extra TEXT(5), read the table names of OpenSchema(adSchemaTables) and the field count of 'SELECT * FROM Items', RollbackTrans, and read both again with a SELECT COUNT(*) FROM TxnDdl; then the same sequence ending with CommitTrans. Asks whether DDL is transactional, what the schema rowset shows inside and after the transaction and the errors.",
